---
/**
 * Page-specific (how-it-works): a small inline highlight chip, an eye-anchor
 * for the one standout fact in a prose stretch. Filled surface, no border.
 * Theme-aware via Starlight tokens. Pass the text as the default slot.
 */
---

<span class="chip"><slot /></span>

<style>
  .chip {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--sl-color-text-accent) 12%, var(--sl-color-bg));
  }
</style>
